{"id":"ad6be0d5d62b418a","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-second-isomorphism.md","title":"Second Isomorphism","display":"Second Isomorphism","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-second-isomorphism","aliases":["93-lem-second-isomorphism"],"display":"Second Isomorphism","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-subalgebra]]","[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]","[[93-df-homomorphic-image]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-second-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-second-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Second Isomorphism"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"18afee354a7c01b0\" href=\"?note=18afee354a7c01b0\" title=\"93-df-homomorphic-image\">93-df-homomorphic-image</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-second-isomorphism---Second-Isomorphism\">lem-second-isomorphism - Second Isomorphism</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}\\)</span> are the type-indexed quotient and projection constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a>; restricting the latter induces the displayed image algebra.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is the image-algebra constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"18afee354a7c01b0\" href=\"?note=18afee354a7c01b0\" title=\"93-df-homomorphic-image\">93-df-homomorphic-image</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> is the isomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\bigl(\nh,\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\theta\\cap|\\mathbf B|^2;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)|_{|\\mathbf B|};\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau),\\tau\\bigr)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\bigl(\nh,\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\theta\\cap|\\mathbf B|^2;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)|_{|\\mathbf B|};\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau),\\tau\\bigr)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This restriction form is the first isomorphism theorem applied to the\nquotient map restricted to the subalgebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B\">\\(\\mathbf B\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-second-isomorphism---Second-Isomorphism","text":"lem-second-isomorphism - Second Isomorphism","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subalgebra","status":"resolved","id":"154cc3ca1a9b40e2","ancho